{"seq":1,"slug":"project-setup","title":"项目搭建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/foundations/project-setup","wordCount":802,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目搭建\">项目搭建</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>搭建 AI Agent 平台的第一步不是写业务逻辑，而是立好工程骨架。本项目采用 Monorepo 结构，把 agent 服务、Web 前端、共享类型三个关注点放进同一个仓库、却保持各自独立的包边界——这样类型契约只需定义一次、两端共用，依赖升级也在一处生效，避免三个仓库之间来回同步版本。</p>\n<p>拆分的依据是「谁负责什么、谁依赖谁」：agent 是唯一持有 API Key 与模型调用的进程，web 只消费 HTTP 接口，shared 不含任何运行时逻辑、仅承载跨端共享的类型定义。三者构成单向依赖——web → shared、agent → shared，shared 不反向依赖任何一方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>agent</code></td>\n<td>Hono API 服务，承载模型调用、工具执行、路由</td>\n<td>hono、@hono/node-server、ai、@ai-sdk/openai、zod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>web</code></td>\n<td>React 前端，负责交互界面与流式渲染</td>\n<td>vite、react、@ai-sdk/react</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shared</code></td>\n<td>跨端共享的类型契约，无运行时逻辑</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套骨架的价值在于把「边界」提前固化：providers/tools/skills 的目录结构与 shared 的类型契约在初始化时就立起来，后续每一章新增的能力都往既有格子里放，而不是让一个文件越堆越大。下面先建立工程骨架，再逐层填入代码。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"整体架构\">整体架构</h2><p>AI Agent 平台采用 Monorepo 结构，将 agent 服务、Web 前端和共享类型放在同一仓库中管理。Hono 作为轻量级 API 框架运行在 agent 服务端，React 负责前端交互界面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Monorepo 根目录&#10;        ROOT[ai-agent-platform/]&#10;        ROOT --&gt; AGENT[agent/&lt;br/&gt;Hono API 服务]&#10;        ROOT --&gt; WEB[web/&lt;br/&gt;React 前端]&#10;        ROOT --&gt; SHARED[shared/&lt;br/&gt;共享类型与工具]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph agent 内部结构&#10;        AGENT --&gt; ROUTES[routes/&lt;br/&gt;API 路由]&#10;        AGENT --&gt; PROVIDERS[providers/&lt;br/&gt;模型 Provider]&#10;        AGENT --&gt; TOOLS[tools/&lt;br/&gt;Agent 工具]&#10;        AGENT --&gt; SKILLS[skills/&lt;br/&gt;Skill 定义]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph web 内部结构&#10;        WEB --&gt; PAGES[pages/&lt;br/&gt;页面组件]&#10;        WEB --&gt; COMPONENTS[components/&lt;br/&gt;UI 组件]&#10;        WEB --&gt; HOOKS[hooks/&lt;br/&gt;自定义 Hook]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Monorepo 根目录\n        ROOT[ai-agent-platform/]\n        ROOT --&gt; AGENT[agent/&lt;br/&gt;Hono API 服务]\n        ROOT --&gt; WEB[web/&lt;br/&gt;React 前端]\n        ROOT --&gt; SHARED[shared/&lt;br/&gt;共享类型与工具]\n    end\n    subgraph agent 内部结构\n        AGENT --&gt; ROUTES[routes/&lt;br/&gt;API 路由]\n        AGENT --&gt; PROVIDERS[providers/&lt;br/&gt;模型 Provider]\n        AGENT --&gt; TOOLS[tools/&lt;br/&gt;Agent 工具]\n        AGENT --&gt; SKILLS[skills/&lt;br/&gt;Skill 定义]\n    end\n    subgraph web 内部结构\n        WEB --&gt; PAGES[pages/&lt;br/&gt;页面组件]\n        WEB --&gt; COMPONENTS[components/&lt;br/&gt;UI 组件]\n        WEB --&gt; HOOKS[hooks/&lt;br/&gt;自定义 Hook]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"初始化项目\">初始化项目</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir ai-agent-platform &amp;&amp; cd ai-agent-platform&#10;pnpm init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ai-agent-platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ai-agent-platform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><p>创建 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 定义 workspace 范围：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"packages:&#10;  - &#39;agent&#39;&#10;  - &#39;web&#39;&#10;  - &#39;shared&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'agent'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'web'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shared'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>根目录 <code>package.json</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;ai-agent-platform&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;pnpm -r --parallel run dev&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dev:agent&quot;: &quot;pnpm --filter agent dev&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dev:web&quot;: &quot;pnpm --filter web dev&quot;,&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;pnpm -r run build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: &quot;pnpm -r run typecheck&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;^5.7.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ai-agent-platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r --parallel run dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev:agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm --filter agent dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev:web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm --filter web dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm -r run typecheck\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"devDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typescript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^5.7.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-配置\">TypeScript 配置</h2><p>根目录 <code>tsconfig.base.json</code> 统一编译选项：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ES2022&quot;,&#10;    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;ESNext&quot;,&#10;    &quot;moduleResolution&quot;: &quot;bundler&quot;,&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;esModuleInterop&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;skipLibCheck&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;sourceMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;resolveJsonModule&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;isolatedModules&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ES2022\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ESNext\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moduleResolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bundler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"esModuleInterop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"skipLibCheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sourceMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"resolveJsonModule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"isolatedModules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"搭建-agent-服务\">搭建 Agent 服务</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir -p agent/src/{routes,providers,tools,skills}&#10;cd agent &amp;&amp; pnpm init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> agent/src/{routes,providers,tools,skills}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> agent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><p>agent/package.json：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;agent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;tsx watch src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;tsup src/index.ts --format esm&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot